                  {" "}
                  {
                    __(
                      "Your team stays focused on product. Probo handles the compliance program end to end, before and after certification, with an open source platform that keeps everything transparent and yours.",
                    )
                  }
                </p>
              </div>

              <div class="border-border-low rounded-lg border p-4">
                <p>
                  <strong class="text-foreground"
                    >{
                      __(
                        "If you want ongoing managed compliance with monthly engagement — consider Bright Defense.",
                      )
                    }</strong
